{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_046rio01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_046rio01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c75de30594bd9cfe9b1c3e232bffdc2f8dc6bc33a47b947953e0613d1235f5b2", "ja": "莉緒とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和莉绪一起外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_046rio01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_046rio01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "390d49959489dff5a41ea4165575b0381728e1c60a6dee5b9c2ab1440c0e5f53", "ja": "（莉緒と、ロケで温泉に来た。\nさすが、有名な温泉だけあって風情があるな）", "zh": "（和莉绪一起来温泉取景了。\n不愧是有名的温泉，很有韵味啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_046rio01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_046rio01_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "36aa0486b44509a89552f6cb3b015c7ea59cfe76bdc3683215a07afcfc72a74b", "ja": "景色がとってもキレイねぇ。空気もおいしいし……\n温泉ロケ、最高じゃない♪", "zh": "风景真的好美哦。空气也很清新……\n温泉外景拍摄，真是太棒了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_046rio01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_046rio01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b8445a6e3e1755cc8e9569f5338ba58cb3e94aa7bce20dc7db4530374b8e0f8c", "ja": "山の麓に広がる温泉地だけあって、自然が豊かだな。\n癒されそうだ。", "zh": "真不愧是坐落在山脚下的温泉胜地，自然风光真好啊。\n感觉整个人都要被治愈了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_046rio01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_046rio01_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "51dcd1f62346a0c0e0507d6c4d7e60500b014641b974f8abf4d32441e8f8cbcd", "ja": "ええ。しかもここの温泉、美肌効果があるんですって！\nしっかりお肌を磨いて帰らなくちゃ……！", "zh": "是啊。而且听说这里的温泉还有美容养颜的功效呢！\n得好好保养一下皮肤再回去才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_046rio01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_046rio01_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "b9054310c6f4aa3850a4ac5eb83165c88a55f25740fb604ca731e8c42eeaea38", "ja": "ほのぼのとした旅番組なのに、セクシーすぎて\nNGになっちゃうかもしれないわね？　ウフフ♪", "zh": "明明是温馨的旅行节目，却可能因为太性感而被打回禁播呢？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_046rio01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_046rio01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "486c99452397780615e0b30cff40decdec01d6ef71bd5257693e6828323ccb9d", "ja": "そうならないように、アピールはほどほどにな。\n温泉の良さを伝える仕事なんだし。", "zh": "为了避免变成那样，宣传还是适可而止吧。毕竟这是传达温泉魅力的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_046rio01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_046rio01_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "4bc2bc8ea8e2899e56a36a65e1d2e7bbcc1ae664cc0ba61c1ac67d157d6cb31f", "ja": "もう、わかってるわよ！　{$P$}くん\nったら、私の入浴シーンが楽しみじゃないの？", "zh": "真是的，我知道啦！{$P$}你\n这家伙，难道就不期待我泡温泉的画面吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_046rio01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_046rio01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3aa6a47f4b1b778592175694815edf2f95abe523ef99a8ac0905f84e859232a1", "ja": "俺はともかく……\n楽しみにしてるファンの人達は、多いと思うよ。", "zh": "我就先不说了……\n我觉得，期待着这个的粉丝应该有很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_046rio01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_046rio01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2bb82ee63c16c0b71f8a2ade6414480d004ac5e57dda1663790ab75ec317c18b", "ja": "莉緒を初めて見る人達も、「この綺麗な女性は\n誰だろう？」って、気になるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "第一次见到莉緒的人，也会好奇\"这位漂亮的女性是谁啊\"，我觉得应该会这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_046rio01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_046rio01_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "3513a96a27cdeeb91a2e962bca6ae6526a7151d3bafcd7018a3ad445504cc3a1", "ja": "えっ。き、綺麗な女性……？\nやだもう、{$P$}くんったら！", "zh": "诶，漂、漂亮的女性……？\n真是的，{$P$}君！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_046rio01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_046rio01_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "9a498a9a58970e726a56da51473f528f6b2665bbf479c1f2fba3e29724bab2df", "ja": "私、がんばらなくちゃ……\nさ、さっそく、準備してくるわねっ！", "zh": "我得加把劲才行……\n那、那我马上去准备了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
